# What NOT to upload when deploying from this directory.
#
# Vercel builds the web bundle from source (see vercel.json buildCommand), so
# it needs the Expo app source and nothing else. Without this file the CLI
# tries to upload android/ (3.9 GB of Gradle output) and node_modules (6.4 GB)
# and the upload aborts before a build ever starts.
#
# android/ in particular must never be uploaded: it is a native build tree,
# irrelevant to the web target, and it carries the hand-patched Gradle files
# (PLAN.md §7 #14) that have nothing to do with this deploy.

node_modules
android
ios
dist
.expo
.gradle
.android-patches
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
.idea
